# .NET / C# preset for gh skim.

# NuGet lock files, resolved from project files that are reviewed.
**/packages.lock.json

# Designer and source-generator output. The .resx, .xaml or attribute that
# produced it is what gets reviewed.
**/*.Designer.cs
**/*.g.cs
**/*.g.i.cs

# Intermediate build output. Should not be committed, sometimes is. bin/ is
# left out on purpose: plenty of repositories keep hand-written scripts there.
**/obj/**

# Note: Entity Framework migrations are deliberately NOT here, except for their
# .Designer.cs metadata above. The migration itself can drop a column, and
# someone has to read that.
